WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.134 --> 00:00:02.902
-Welcome back to
"The Tonight Show."

00:00:02.902 --> 00:00:05.338
I am here with the hilarious
Kristen Wiig right here!

00:00:05.338 --> 00:00:06.772
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:06.772 --> 00:00:08.674
"Wonder Woman 1984."

00:00:08.674 --> 00:00:10.610
Now, Kristen,
we always do something fun

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:11.911
when you're on the show.

00:00:11.911 --> 00:00:15.548
With that in mind, it's time for
the "Mimic Challenge."

00:00:15.548 --> 00:00:17.717
-♪ Mimic challenge ♪

00:00:17.717 --> 00:00:20.820
♪ Mimic, mimic challenge, yeah ♪

00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:22.154
-Alright, now,
here's how it works.

00:00:22.154 --> 00:00:25.291
We have a bunch of items
to make noise with.

00:00:25.291 --> 00:00:27.259
We're gonna take turns making
a sound with an object,

00:00:27.259 --> 00:00:30.195
and then the other person has to
immediately match that sound

00:00:30.195 --> 00:00:32.832
as precisely as they can.

00:00:32.832 --> 00:00:36.369
-I'm so bad at this.

00:00:36.369 --> 00:00:37.637
I don't know why
I said yes to this.

00:00:37.637 --> 00:00:41.074
-No, I think --
-No, I'm so -- Okay, we'll see.

00:00:41.074 --> 00:00:42.308
-We're gonna
match the sound effect.

00:00:42.308 --> 00:00:43.442
People have been doing it
on TikTok.

00:00:43.442 --> 00:00:46.412
I've seen it. It's funny.
It's fun.

00:00:46.412 --> 00:00:48.981
I will make the first noise,
and then I'll say,

00:00:48.981 --> 00:00:52.117
"Kristen, make this sound,"
and then you'll say it.

00:00:52.117 --> 00:00:54.120
-But I'm watching what you --
-Yes, you're watching.

00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:55.521
I'll say,
"Kristen, make this sound."

00:00:55.521 --> 00:00:57.222
I'll do the sound,
and then you have to make it.

00:00:57.222 --> 00:00:58.258
-Okay.
-Ready?

00:00:58.258 --> 00:01:00.359
-Yeah.

00:01:00.359 --> 00:01:03.429
-Kristen, make this sound.

00:01:03.429 --> 00:01:05.864
[ Clicks ]

00:01:05.864 --> 00:01:07.032
-[ Imitates clicking ]

00:01:07.032 --> 00:01:08.067
[ Ding ]

00:01:08.067 --> 00:01:12.338
-[ Laughs ] What?
That was fantastic.

00:01:12.338 --> 00:01:13.639
Alright, now this is your turn,
whenever you're ready.

00:01:13.639 --> 00:01:17.844
-Okay. Jimmy, I need you
to make this sound.

00:01:17.844 --> 00:01:19.845
[ Ripping ]

00:01:19.845 --> 00:01:21.013
-[ Imitates ripping ]

00:01:21.013 --> 00:01:23.115
[ Ding ]
♪♪

00:01:23.115 --> 00:01:24.483
That was good.

00:01:24.483 --> 00:01:27.186
-Kristen, make this sound.

00:01:27.186 --> 00:01:31.890
[ Tearing ]

00:01:31.890 --> 00:01:33.192
-[ Imitates tearing ]

00:01:33.192 --> 00:01:37.263
[ Ding ]
♪♪

00:01:37.263 --> 00:01:40.466
-Jimmy, please make this sound.

00:01:40.466 --> 00:01:43.102
[ Crunching, popping ]

00:01:43.102 --> 00:01:45.004
-[ Imitates crunching ]

00:01:45.004 --> 00:01:47.040
[ Ding ]
♪♪

00:01:51.277 --> 00:01:55.348
Oh, my God!
-Kristen, make this sound.

00:01:55.348 --> 00:01:57.717
[ Squeaking ]

00:01:57.717 --> 00:01:59.819
-[ Imitates squeaking ]

00:01:59.819 --> 00:02:02.688
[ Ding ]
♪♪

00:02:02.688 --> 00:02:06.826
-[ Laughing ] So bad. Terrible.

00:02:06.826 --> 00:02:09.896
Okay, Jimmy,
please make this sound.

00:02:09.896 --> 00:02:13.565
[ Rattling ]

00:02:13.565 --> 00:02:14.900
-[ Imitates rattling ]

00:02:14.900 --> 00:02:15.901
[ Ding ]
♪♪

00:02:15.901 --> 00:02:19.038
-Something like that?
-Yes.

00:02:19.038 --> 00:02:23.543
-Alright, Kristen,
make this sound.

00:02:24.710 --> 00:02:29.749
[ High-pitched squeak ]

00:02:29.749 --> 00:02:30.917
-Wait. Do it again.

00:02:30.917 --> 00:02:33.820
[ High-pitched squeak ]

00:02:33.820 --> 00:02:35.988
-[ Imitates squeaking ]

00:02:35.988 --> 00:02:37.590
[ Ding ]
-Oh, my God!

00:02:37.590 --> 00:02:39.925
You're actually
phenomenal at this.

00:02:39.925 --> 00:02:41.094
This is unbelievable,
how great you are.

00:02:41.094 --> 00:02:43.729
-Oh, come on. Okay, ready?
-Yeah.

00:02:43.729 --> 00:02:44.797
-Make this sound.
-Oh.

00:02:44.797 --> 00:02:47.734
[ Knocking ]

00:02:47.734 --> 00:02:49.435
-[ Clicks tongue ]

00:02:49.435 --> 00:02:50.436
[ Ding ]
-That was amazing.

00:02:50.436 --> 00:02:51.570
-Not bad?
-No, that was good.

00:02:51.570 --> 00:02:52.872
-That was a tick-tocky.
-That was good.

00:02:52.872 --> 00:02:56.175
-I got tick-tocky in there.
Alright, here we go.

00:02:56.175 --> 00:02:58.377
Kristen...
-Wait. Which part?

00:02:58.377 --> 00:03:00.345
The whole thing?
-No, no, no.

00:03:00.345 --> 00:03:01.747
That will be too hard.
Alright, how about this part?

00:03:01.747 --> 00:03:03.248
Ready?
-Okay.

00:03:03.248 --> 00:03:06.152
Kristen, make this sound.

00:03:06.152 --> 00:03:11.957
[ Gurgling ]

00:03:11.957 --> 00:03:15.561
-[ Imitates gurgling ]

00:03:15.561 --> 00:03:22.434
[ Ding ]
♪♪

00:03:22.434 --> 00:03:24.336
-Okay.
-Yeah.

00:03:24.336 --> 00:03:27.106
-Jimmy...
-Yes?

00:03:27.106 --> 00:03:31.243
-Ready? Make this sound.
-Yeah.

00:03:31.243 --> 00:03:34.180
Wait. Hold on.

00:03:34.180 --> 00:03:35.214
[ Rips, whooshes ]

00:03:35.214 --> 00:03:37.250
[ Laughter ]

00:03:46.526 --> 00:03:53.465
-Can I hear it one more time?
-Yes.

00:03:53.465 --> 00:03:57.703
[ Rips ]

00:03:57.703 --> 00:03:59.338
-[ Imitates ripping ]

00:03:59.338 --> 00:04:00.372
-Yes!
[ Ding ]

00:04:00.372 --> 00:04:03.142
-Was that bad?
-That was good.

00:04:03.142 --> 00:04:04.576
That was good.

00:04:04.576 --> 00:04:07.513
-Alright, Kristen,
make this sound.

00:04:07.513 --> 00:04:09.715
[ Whirs ]

00:04:09.715 --> 00:04:11.150
-[ Imitates whirring ]

00:04:11.150 --> 00:04:14.453
[ Ding ]
♪♪

00:04:14.453 --> 00:04:16.655
Oh.
[ Whirs ]

00:04:16.655 --> 00:04:17.690
[ Imitates whirring ]

00:04:17.690 --> 00:04:20.993
[ Ding ]
♪♪

00:04:20.993 --> 00:04:25.498
Okay. Make this sound.

00:04:25.498 --> 00:04:29.702
[ Clicking ]

00:04:29.702 --> 00:04:32.271
-[ Imitates whooshing,
clicking ]

00:04:32.271 --> 00:04:34.507
[ Ding ]
-Yeah.

00:04:34.507 --> 00:04:35.808
That was hard.
That was really hard.

00:04:35.808 --> 00:04:41.080
-Alright,
Kristen, make this sound.

00:04:41.080 --> 00:04:45.751
[ Buzzing ]

00:04:45.751 --> 00:04:49.889
-Do it again.
[ Buzzing ]

00:04:49.889 --> 00:04:52.358
[ Imitates buzzing ]

00:04:52.358 --> 00:04:56.329
[ Ding ]
♪♪

00:04:56.329 --> 00:04:57.630
Okay. This is your last one.

00:04:57.630 --> 00:04:58.631
This will probably be
my favorite.

00:04:58.631 --> 00:04:59.699
-Alright, I got to
nail this one.

00:04:59.699 --> 00:05:00.700
-Can't believe
I don't own one of these.

00:05:00.700 --> 00:05:03.202
-Here we go. Oh.

00:05:03.202 --> 00:05:05.170
[ Honking ]

00:05:05.170 --> 00:05:06.872
[ Imitates honking ]

00:05:06.872 --> 00:05:08.474
Something like that? Not bad?
Alright, I tried.

00:05:08.474 --> 00:05:10.743
-That was amazing.
-Dude, you crush at this.

00:05:10.743 --> 00:05:11.811
Kristen Wiig, everybody!

00:05:11.811 --> 00:05:14.280
"Wonder Woman 1984" will be in

00:05:14.280 --> 00:05:17.383
select theaters and IMAX
on December 25th

00:05:17.383 --> 00:05:19.485
and on HBO Max the same day.

00:05:19.485 --> 00:05:21.320
And watch Kristen
host "Saturday Night Live"

00:05:21.320 --> 00:05:22.388
this weekend!

